  "display_name": "Hand Clap",
  "display_fullname": "Redirects Super Strength Hand Clap Tanker",
  "display_help": "You can clap your hands together with such force that you create a deafening shockwave. This shockwave can knock back nearby foes, and they have a chance to become Disoriented due to the shock to the inner ear. Hand Clap deals no damage.<br><br><color #fcfc95>Notes: <br>Although this power accepts damage enhancements and sets, they wont do anything if you don't own Unleash Might and toggle it on.<br><br>Thanks to gauntlet, this power can hit up to <color #FF7F27>6</color> targets above its cap at 1/3rd effectiveness.</color>",
